SP - DISPLAY FREE DISK SPACE

CALLER. Subject to the current caller access policy.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
SP - DISPLAY FREE DISK SPACE

CALLER. Subject to the current caller access policy.

Syntax:
    SP [dir:|du:]

Reports free disk space on the selected disk. Example: SP HELP:

Free space is disk-wide, not a private per-user quota. A reported amount
does not imply that callers can write to that directory; BYE policy still
governs access.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
